MMz: matrix([AA[1,1], AA[1,2]], [AA[2,1], AA[2,2]]);

ta1: ev(determinant(MMx),simp)
ta2: ev(-determinant(MMy),simp)
ta3: ev(determinant(MMz),simp)</text>
